# Root (context: .) is consumed by only two images:
#   - openwebui (Dockerfile.openwebui-gpu): no COPY, needs nothing from context
#   - tailscale (dockerfile.tailscale): COPY entrypoint.sh only
# Without this, `docker compose build` ships the ENTIRE workspace
# (backups/, data/, models/, OB1/ — tens of GB) to the daemon as build context.
# Exclude everything, then re-include only the file tailscale copies.
# NOTE: every other service builds from a subdirectory context (./little-coder,
# ./backup, ./config/*, ../mnemory, ...), which this root .dockerignore does NOT affect.
*
!entrypoint.sh
